DESIGN MyChip ;
UNITS DISTANCE MICRONS 1000 ;

DIEAREA ( 0 0 ) ( 5000000 4000000 ) ;

COMPONENTS 5 ;
- U1 AND2 + PLACED ( 1000 2000 ) N ;
- U2 OR2 + PLACED ( 3000 4000 ) N ;
- U3 DFF + PLACED ( 5000 1000 ) N ;
- U4 AND2 + PLACED ( 2000 3000 ) S ;
- U5 INV + PLACED ( 4000 2000 ) N ;
END COMPONENTS

NETS 3 ;
- clk ( U3 CLK ) ;
- data_in ( U1 A ) ( U2 A ) ;
- data_out ( U3 Q ) ( U1 Y ) ;
END NETS